### Database tier ###
# The H2 data file is a build artifact - db/schema.sql and db/seed.sql rebuild it from
# scratch (run-db.ps1 -Init). Committing it would put a binary in git that goes stale the
# moment anyone runs a game.
db/*.mv.db
db/*.trace.db
db/*.lock.db

